// title: Identify MITRE ATT&CK Techniques · Microsoft Defender XDR
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Defender XDR
// tables: AlertInfo
// purpose: The following queries provide for Microsoft Sentinel and Microsoft 365 Defender a graphic representation of MITRE ATT&CK techniques from alerts within the timerange defined.
// source: https://github.com/cyb3rmik3/KQL-threat-hunting-queries/blob/6327d5a78455432e0dbd32cb5c8c281e6f7fda05/03.SecOps/identify-mitreattack-techniques.md
// kind: repo
// author: Michalis Michalos
// license: MIT (as stated by the repository)
// archived by tools/kql_archive.py (CLAUDE.md 5l, 5eu)
AlertInfo
// Define timerange
| where Timestamp > ago(30d)
| where AttackTechniques != ""
| mvexpand todynamic(AttackTechniques)
| summarize count() by tostring(AttackTechniques)
// Define graphic
| render piechart
